{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00495","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 雍和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俎豆有践，黄流在尊。\n九宫之祀，三代莫存。\n乐变六宫，坛开八门。\n圣皇昭对，佑我黎元。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00495.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00495","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}